  "_ci_method": "Percentile bootstrap of the mean over pairs: 2,000 resamples, numpy default_rng(seed=0) re-seeded for each statistic, rng.choice with replacement, 2.5/97.5% quantiles; float32 oracle scores (exactly dmfm.experiments.score_c0_oracle --bootstrap 2000 --seed 0, the method behind the submitted Table 1).",
