  "_sampler": "dMFM-posterior value-gradient guidance on the parent-disjoint L=50 base flow: value gradients from 1 composed flow-map steps of the L=50 dMFM (epoch=95-step=49000.ckpt), mc 32 frozen per-sample pool, nfe_traj 64, guidance_frac 8.0, reward_sigma 0.15, reward_scale 0.5, t in [0.5, 0.95], t_max 0.95, seed 0, batch 8, noise-paired guided/unguided samples. Identical to the GLASS Table 1 protocol except for the posterior sampler (dmfm.experiments.sample_c0_guidance_dmfm --paired --posterior dmfm).",
